  Router --> UI: 4.2. HTTP error
  UI --> User: 4.3. Show error
end

NotificationController -> NotificationService: 5. get notifications
activate NotificationService

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: 6. find notifications
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> MongoDB: 7. get notifications
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> NotificationModel: 8. notification list
deactivate MongoDB
